OL,3,GNEWSATrams halted due to emergency work
OL,4,Aon track
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrams have stopped running in part of
OL,7,FNottingham to allow for "emergency
OL,8,Fwork" to be carried out on a section of
OL,9,Ftrack.
OL,11,FNottingham Express Transit (NET) said
OL,12,Fservices between Wilkinson Street and
OL,13,FThe Forest in the Hyson Green zone were
OL,14,Faffected.
OL,16,FLonger wait times are also expected for
OL,17,Ftrams between The Forest, Clifton South
OL,18,Fand Toton Lane, it added.
OL,20,FA replacement bus will operate between
OL,21,FWilkinson Street Park & Ride and The
OL,22,FForest Park & Ride.
